{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415012","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415012","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041501201:1":{"text":"Oh no, what to do with these herbs?","source_cn":"哎呀，这些草药可怎么办呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4EFB49CD22F872F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041501202:0":{"text":"Not exactly fresh, but cheap!","source_cn":"虽然不太新鲜，但——但它便宜啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC105AF458EB21AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041501203:1":{"text":"Cheap?! Where's the cheap stuff?","source_cn":"便宜？！哪里有便宜货！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B4562D1677A891","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041501204:1":{"text":"You're talking about these? Not bad, not bad.","source_cn":"哦哦哦，就是这些吗？不错，不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1290B7AAF8ED2D68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041501205:1":{"text":"Say, pal, be honest, how cheap can you go?","source_cn":"那，老弟，你实话说，能便宜多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x629AC85BFD0F0D86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041501206:1":{"text":"Come on, buddy, I saved these for last for a reason, and there will be a discount. However...","source_cn":"哎呀，老兄，不是我说，这些草药可是我特意留到最后的压箱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA10C60BB8CA4539","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041501207:1":{"text":"Well, given the wear and storage costs, how about 90% off? Take it or leave it?","source_cn":"那么，算上折损和储存费用，就这个价吧：一折！你卖不卖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98476AFB67632149","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041501208:1":{"text":"Heh, I guess we ought to have a talk. How about we go grab a round somewhere?","source_cn":"哼哼，看样子咱们得好好聊聊了，要不这样，老兄，咱们去喝一杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2657667429FF956","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041501209:1":{"text":"I can provide a long-term supply of many different herbs, so just let me know what you want. As for the price... we'll negotiate.","source_cn":"我平时还能长期供货不少草药，你有什么要的，尽管跟我说…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x571BE268D847AB5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041501210:1":{"text":"Cheaper by the bulk? Ahem, sure. Why don't we grab a drink... on you!","source_cn":"量大从优？咳嗯……不错啊。那，我们去喝一杯！这次你付账！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A5656DBBA652262","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿德":{"text":"Odie","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"Smokey","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}